# PRECOMMIT.list — the slt-smoke subset (design D6).
# One path per line, from the REPOSITORY ROOT — not relative to this
# file or to the corpus directory. A path of the other shape is reported
# as `listed file missing`, which reads like a deleted corpus file.
#
# Every `15_regressions` fixture must appear here, and the runner FAILS
# on one that does not (`unlisted_regressions`). It used to say the tier
# warned on strays; nothing did, and by v7.39.4 forty-three fixtures —
# every regression written since v7.38.13 — had never run at precommit.
#
# All of 15_regressions — regressions are precommit's reason to exist:
